  "description": "Further South is a furry convention in Portsmouth, Hampshire, England, organized by Wyvern Events, which also ran a trip to the New Forest called Forest Tails. It was first planned for September 2024 at the Holiday Inn Portsmouth, was rescheduled because of date conflicts with other conventions, and was held March 15 to 17, 2025, with over 80 tickets sold. The convention chair and art lead is DerpyDoo, and the mascot is Kevin, a surfing otter. Its branding was also used for a virtual convention, Further Apart, in 2020.",
